OL,3,GNEWSASeal 'anchored' down by debris
OL,4,Aneeds months of care
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Doughnut had become severely entangled
OL,7,Fin a mass of netting, twine, fishing
OL,8,Fhooks and metal," said centre manager
OL,9,FEvangelos Achilleos.
